## Classification

| Blocking | Minor | Accepted |
|---|---|---|
| Breaks approved layout or a required state; visible wrong component/token; unreadable or inaccessible; copy that changes meaning | Small spacing/alignment differences without impact | Covered by a recorded decision ({{decision_notation}}) |

